      <slug></slug>
      <title>Metisse: this is not a 3D desktop!</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>CrossDesktop</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Metisse is an X-based window system designed with two goals in mind.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;First, it should make it easy for HCI researchers to design and implement innovative window management techniques Second, it should conform to existing standards and be robust and efficient enough to be used on a daily basis, making it a suitable platform for the evaluation of the proposed techniques.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="121">Frédéric Crozat</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>